[{"title":"哭留守公四章 其三","author":"钱澄之","text":"仙翁授记有玄机，为说扶公返旧扉。\n共信锦衣思结伴，讵知马革是「荣归」！\n慈孙收血奔难到，爱子趋庭志已违！\n传说吴江杨义士，窃携骸骨出重围。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9200,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭留守公四章 其四","author":"钱澄之","text":"天隅文物仗公存，多士从龙半在门。\n疏拙无因频荷荐，圣明不用亦衔恩。\n特乘休沐趋戎慕，为献新诗赏直言。\n回忆虞山高宴夜，桂华明月最伤魂！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9201,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭张司马四首 其一","author":"钱澄之","text":"负郭秋灯聚草堂，江头送别色凄凉。\n申胥复楚功难就，张悌捐躯志竟偿！\n报国正宜留热血，完名何苦殉危疆？\n天涯屈指奇男子，忆尔雄姿泪几行！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9202,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭张司马四首 其二","author":"钱澄之","text":"下笔真惊倚马奇，逢君酒后兴何悲！\n雄文不草收京檄，绝命空传骂贼诗！\n七日忍饥还唱和，九原有伴足追随。\n樽前怪尔须髯戟，长似睢阳嚼齿时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9203,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭张司马四首 其三","author":"钱澄之","text":"榕江大帅已全奔，坚卧要谁驻壁门。\n好养健儿曾吮血，更无弱息与招魂！\n老妻浅土何人葬？\n遗稿烽中几册存！\n敢信江陵遂不祀，荆州或有相公孙！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9204,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭张司马四首 其四","author":"钱澄之","text":"并马江头向碧岑，星岩龙隐日追寻。\n看君摇笔须眉动，把我新诗泣涕吟。\n难后尚随门下吏，箧中长宝故人簪。\n同人属和张、瞿韵，几度拈来痛不任！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9205,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浔州帅","author":"钱澄之","text":"夙昔不齿浔州帅，冒封大国殊可愧！\n跋扈抗命诸镇无，阴谋矫诏中朝祟。\n龙舟仓卒向西巡，放兵大掠左江滨。\n百官扈从纷相失，道路梗塞困小臣。\n焦侯平乐城不守，单骑追驾向南走。\n祗闻假道上乌蛮，何意投躯喂虎口！\n浔帅乞降苦无由，要侯请解昔日仇。\n杯酒未终侯遇害，遣儿来献焦侯头！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9206,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过羊城纪事","author":"钱澄之","text":"不信粤东破，坚城岂望援！\n捷书方狎至，残骑欲宵奔。\n振旅全浮海，空营始献门。\n西关输款将，遗恨范承恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9207,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虔州有怀","author":"钱澄之","text":"月映荒城夜泊舟，昔贤义气此中休。\n曾惊?篥罗毡帐，忽见嵯峨笑虎头。\n胡运未终江右败，将星初堕岭南忧。\n楼船官舍衔杯处，回首天涯忆二刘！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9208,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上天堂山访隐，主人不顾，作诗而去","author":"钱澄之","text":"出关何意再还闽，拟向千峰老此身。\n幸有香台堪遁世，况多道伴可成邻！\n岭云自去谁留客，巢鹤惊飞亦避人。\n吾道既非应共弃，莫疑物态有疏亲！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9209,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭峡江曾二云老师 其一","author":"钱澄之","text":"凶问初传暗里惊，闽关趼足为谁行？\n踏穿岭表三山近，望到天隅一柱倾！\n沧海未能容信国，白头毕竟丧真卿！\n同时义士吞声泣，不为门墙独惨情！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9210,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭峡江曾二云老师 其二","author":"钱澄之","text":"冰蘖清风海内望，至今遗爱泣闽乡。\n身栖绝岛思存宋，梦入先朝只辅唐。\n闾里自来臣节著，家门都为国恩亡。\n相随犹有雏孙在，此日巢倾若与藏！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9211,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭峡江曾二云老师 其三","author":"钱澄之","text":"有客乘风自厦门，灵光孤殿岿然存。\n阃权海上尊元老，封事天南动至尊。\n蜡诏未叨明主赐，麻纶犹出上皇恩。\n新衔鹊印随颁给，曾慰孤臣万里心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9212,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭峡江曾二云老师 其四","author":"钱澄之","text":"昔岁谬叨漳浦荐，主恩特诏试天官。\n书生不以先容进，国士偏承破格看。\n一命滥参延郡幕，三年窃戴侍臣冠。\n同时知己捐躯尽，每念师恩泪未乾！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9213,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曼公书至，得山阴师死事信 其一","author":"钱澄之","text":"去岁风闻疑至今，客来果说大星沈。\n青天已毕蠲躯志，白日空悬报主心！\n多难相依臣节苦，异时不去国恩深。\n中兴未奏公先死，泪洒天南听捷音！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9214,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曼公书至，得山阴师死事信 其二","author":"钱澄之","text":"共羡吾师遇主知，五年车驾镇相随。\n边书忽到催朝急，密旨偏承下直迟。\n血碧人间千载恨，柱摧天外九重悲。\n乘舆此日蛮荒外，左右颠危更仗谁！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9215,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曼公书至，得山阴师死事信 其三","author":"钱澄之","text":"曾为三策筹滇事，纶阁传看亦动容。\n庭议只知争祖制，帝心原自慎藩封。\n图纾国难身先殒，为荷君恩祸独钟！\n门下夕郎同日死，九原含笑得相从。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9216,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曼公书至，得山阴师死事信 其四","author":"钱澄之","text":"制科忝出陆公门，同是门生独荷恩。\n规讽每蒙倾耳听，询谋偏许纵情论。\n受知不浅常跻阁，相见无时特谕阍。\n何事违师苦求去，祗今西望漫伤魂！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9217,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其一","author":"钱澄之","text":"望见梧云路不通，西来贯甲引弓雄。\n邻船烧尽榜人窜，独树孤舟系晚风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9218,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二","author":"钱澄之","text":"夜黑山深暴雨催，虎狼队里脱身来。\n孝廉认得同行伴，映竹茅斋为我开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9219,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三","author":"钱澄之","text":"竹屋初糊未稳眠，山猺窃发又纷然。\n滩头便是焚舟处，仍杂村氓上渡船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9220,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四","author":"钱澄之","text":"斗柄横参冬已残，蛮方天气不知寒。\n梅花一树牛栏外，每日扶藜两度看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9221,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五","author":"钱澄之","text":"谁传邸诏到山扃，信是乘舆驻朗宁。\n愁绝浔州江路断，致身那得奋飞翎！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9222,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其六","author":"钱澄之","text":"穷山雨闭吏人呼，缯缴漫漫何处逋？\n几度被兵装已尽，倾家急难是苍梧！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9223,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其七","author":"钱澄之","text":"经旬守渡坐江头，典尽春衣问小舟。\n偏遇买粮船正过，弯弓停楫在中流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9224,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其八","author":"钱澄之","text":"多难逢君事已迟，偷生到此岂宜悲！\n可怜身外无长物，留取孤臣一卷诗！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9225,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其九","author":"钱澄之","text":"憔悴累囚生意微，思归应是梦中归。\n山头却望摩空鸟，那得凌风学尔飞！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9226,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十","author":"钱澄之","text":"孤儿相失已三年，万死蛮烟觅汝还。\n日夕牵衣今又散，乱山何处哭苍天！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9227,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十一","author":"钱澄之","text":"日落孤村数已穷，摩刀相向忽开笼。\n草间一夜成甘寝，病骨何曾解怕风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9228,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十二","author":"钱澄之","text":"近关怕见北军装，掩面叉胸避道旁。\n忽说姓名惊改色，声音认得是同乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9229,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十三","author":"钱澄之","text":"十日无栖此夜偏，故人布被拟同眠。\n那知难后贫如我，抵足牛衣剧可怜！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9230,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十四","author":"钱澄之","text":"乞假辞朝去未回，伤心囚服此时来！\n龙舟驻处江声急，辇路荒残马矢堆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9231,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十五","author":"钱澄之","text":"五更起坐自温经，还似书声静夜听。\n梵唱自矜能仿佛，老僧本色是优伶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9232,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十六","author":"钱澄之","text":"刺史乡情荷已多，艰危无奈故人何！\n才从虎穴全巢卵，又送穷鱼脱网罗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9233,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十七","author":"钱澄之","text":"寄语西村老布袍，旧时笥箧等閒抛。\n新诗一字浑忘却，壁上留题为我抄！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9234,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十八","author":"钱澄之","text":"赤脚敲门是再生，痴儿留得故人情。\n邻妪辍泣来相废，笑指今晨有哭声！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9235,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其十九","author":"钱澄之","text":"惭负当年博奥声，车裘已尽听君行。\n三更病渴思涓滴，错唤獠奴阿段名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9236,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十","author":"钱澄之","text":"望见星岩泪已潸，稽呵有吏认愁颜。\n端州太守曾相识，一字包羞许过关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9237,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十一","author":"钱澄之","text":"郡阁相邀揖罢还，传心御幄敢跻攀。\n使君莫怪频流涕，原是螭头旧侍班。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9238,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十二","author":"钱澄之","text":"阛阓烧残遍垝垣，徘徊难觅旧居门。\n老兵病卧前相问，为指孤吟阁尚存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9239,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十三","author":"钱澄之","text":"吾乡幕客老天隅，为拟东还结伴趋。\n难后赤身行不得，重怜觅渡向苍梧！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9240,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十四","author":"钱澄之","text":"转眼佣奴便作威，解骖属望故人非。\n同乡好友输金足，惭愧全家尽赎归！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9241,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十五","author":"钱澄之","text":"好事潘生剧可怜，从龙身丧左江边！\n僮奴掠卖胡军里，说著低声泪点悬！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9242,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十六","author":"钱澄之","text":"难后同年尚几存，惠州高蹈早为髡。\n闭门野史犹堪葺，莫负临轩特典恩！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9243,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十七","author":"钱澄之","text":"连朝水长过山腰，村市填波波怒号。\n估客一时牵缆去，榜人呼我共撑篙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9244,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十八","author":"钱澄之","text":"准拟龙车尔定随，那期雁字又参差。\n老兄愿让「生还集」，乞与同门标近诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9245,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其二十九","author":"钱澄之","text":"维舟崖寺试追攀，却说飞来自皖山。\n乡国十年归未得，暂留此地算生还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9246,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十","author":"钱澄之","text":"城上钟鸣作吼声，旧传此物是龙精。\n城亡一夜摩空去，不与人间报五更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9247,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十一","author":"钱澄之","text":"寄语茅坪跛阿师，故人过岭也披缁。\n追寻万里门生谊，莫老蛮方负所思！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9248,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十二","author":"钱澄之","text":"双脚蹒跚卧路陲，客来相慰漫兴悲！\n乘舆何处吾归去，可是高车驷马时？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9249,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十三","author":"钱澄之","text":"严城背日客心哀，往事凄凉对劫灰。\n江右、岭南千古恨，不堪回首郁孤台！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9250,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十四","author":"钱澄之","text":"逆旅逢亲意转迷，无家归去傍人栖。\n出门斜指芦帘内，说是同乡别驾妻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9251,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十五","author":"钱澄之","text":"寄去家书到未曾，烦君口信字难凭！\n故园兄弟休痴望，头白归来是老僧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9252,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十六","author":"钱澄之","text":"江村初夏树阴阴，望去禾新客途深。\n跋涉最怜孺子苦，麻鞋破脚暗伤心！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9253,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十七","author":"钱澄之","text":"刚是行年四十来，不堪人事首重回！\n只今出世毋嫌晚，便算兹辰降母胎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9254,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十八","author":"钱澄之","text":"江村竞渡鼓声新，卧病惊闻初度辰。\n莫道五丝难续命，看予几度再生身！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9255,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其三十九","author":"钱澄之","text":"三年习气已消磨，曾约东还此再过。\n古寺烧残老僧死，留予一顶教谁摩？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9256,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十","author":"钱澄之","text":"急水回舟认此村，两株榕树覆山门。\n诗笺壁上张如旧，犹带伤秋泪点存！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十一","author":"钱澄之","text":"铁屩磨穿海上来，仙师有约到蓬莱。\n黑风一夜三山失，却望沧波痛哭回！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十二","author":"钱澄之","text":"移居深巷叩柴荆，问姓开门半日惊。\n更说与君惊绝事，痴儿寻得已随行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十三","author":"钱澄之","text":"此地招寻独有君，惊看须鬓雪纷纷。\n姓名祗许孙嵩识，莫遗通村父老闻！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9260,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十四","author":"钱澄之","text":"自逃方外久忘机，特访名山入翠微。\n谷鸟相猜有何意，避人穿过隔溪飞？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9261,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十五","author":"钱澄之","text":"萧寺炊烟渐欲无，僧堂粥饭敢嫌粗！\n苦瓜未熟米、盐绝，吃尽山头雨后菇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9262,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十六","author":"钱澄之","text":"天堂山上人来稀，天堂山僧去不归。\n归时托钵予亦去，回听钟声隔翠微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9263,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十七","author":"钱澄之","text":"扶筇晓上最高峰，岚海平铺四面同。\n此际下方人未醒，茫茫都在白云中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9264,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十八","author":"钱澄之","text":"峚峰关主本同乡，禅寂多年不下床。\n为指蒲团相对坐，沙弥初点一枝香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9265,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其四十九","author":"钱澄之","text":"头白山僧旧说名，早年持律晚尤精。\n客来旋摘新锄菜，打水亲烧折脚铛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9266,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十","author":"钱澄之","text":"吾师托钵事终南，死后依然守一龛。\n说著钳锥随堕泪，旁人不信是同参。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9267,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十一","author":"钱澄之","text":"老僧多病苦修偏，课诵行禅夜不眠。\n更荷慈悲留过客，为怜单被自装绵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9268,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十二","author":"钱澄之","text":"死关侍者老千峰，苦行年深有病容。\n见我橐中衣未制，亲携刀尺与裁缝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9269,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十三","author":"钱澄之","text":"此生已信付寒灰，物外惊疑何处来？\n自是禅心死未尽，尚留俗相与人猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9270,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十四","author":"钱澄之","text":"望去山腰一缕烟，到来钟梵肃诸天。\n道人已习头陀行，为乞蓑衣与种田。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9271,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十五","author":"钱澄之","text":"朝搥钟磬礼袈裟，惭愧男儿始出家！\n胡跪阶前求剃草，可能选佛似丹霞？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9272,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行路难 其五十六","author":"钱澄之","text":"招寻有伴入松关，我自栖山尔自还。\n别后望云无过念，团瓢只在数峰间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":9273,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]